  "description": "Single Family 5 bed semi detached house extended and a loft/dormer space added. Conversion to form two self contained one bed two person flats. \n\nPrevious Approvals:\ni)\t18/5712/192 - Certificate of Lawfulness.\nii)\t24/3669/PNH - Prior Approval.\niii)\t25/0094/HSE - House Holder Permission.\n\nFlats A only is accessible from the ground floor and have private amenity space to rear of property. Also, Friary Park is circa half a mile away from the property, about 15-20 minutes walk from the property.\n\nCycle Storage for 6nº. Cycles provided. Refuse Storage to be within the flank of the site. vehicle parking reduced to one parking space.\n\nThe site has tow parking spaces, of which one closest to the front entrance is a disabled parking bay. Lastly, a Dual charge EVCP is also provided.\n\nThe Front hard standing is to have permeable paving. \n\nA new drop kerb is to be formed on the adopted footpath. 40% of the forecourt is Soft Landscaped.",
